@startuml
actor User
participant "Portal / Wallet" as Portal
participant "Provider Backend" as Backend
participant "Solana Program" as Program
participant "Provider Treasury" as Treasury
participant "VPS" as VPS

User -> Portal : Select the fixed VPS plan
Portal -> Backend : Create order with owner wallet
Backend -> Program : Register reserved server and payment terms
Backend --> Portal : Server record + displayed SOL price
User -> Portal : Approve purchase transaction
Portal -> Program : purchase_access(payment_id), owner signature
Program -> Treasury : Transfer configured SOL amount
Program -> Program : Update subscription + owner grant + receipt atomically
Backend -> Program : Verify finalized receipt and subscription via RPC
Backend -> VPS : Provision VM, install PAM + daemon, configure server_id
Backend -> Backend : Verify provisioning and on-chain access
Backend --> Portal : ACTIVE, IP address, SSH instructions
@enduml
